<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#E5C07B;">-</span><span style="--shiki-light:#986801;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#D19A66;--shiki-dark-font-weight:inherit;"> **Background and problem definition**</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">: where the problem came from, the symptoms, the blast radius</span></span>
